      "writtenOn": "2023-05-11T22:42:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "AFAIK, the i2c_emulator (ec/zephyr/emul/emul_common_i2c.c:247) will check if there is a fake that supercedes another emulator (there is). This will transmit the data over a \"pretend wire\", which will be consumed by i2c_controller code (ec/common/i2c_controller.c:374) and will compare the PEC transmitted against the PEC computed and then return an error if there is a mismatch. \n\nIt is the i2c_controller.c that has the corresponding \"out\" because it was the bus-driver in this request phase of the transaction.",
